# Session cost rows — rewritten wholesale by `scripts/session-cost.ts` on every
# turn, so a formatting pass over them is undone by the next one.
.claude/costs/sessions

# Exported GitHub threads — `scripts/export-github-item.py` writes them verbatim
# from the API, down to the line endings a comment was typed with, and the point
# of re-exporting is a diff against what the last turn read.
docs/issue
docs/pr

